{
  "id": "combine-places",
  "kind": "combine",
  "description": "The union of the ticked places, entries sorted by key, holders in the order of the ticked list. Data: flat holds item-a (n 1), item-b (n 2) and a tombstone for item-c; cabin holds item-c (n 3), item-a (n 4) and a tombstone for item-d; shed holds item-e. Case 1, ticked [flat, cabin]: item-a has holders flat then cabin, item-b flat, item-c only cabin (the flat tombstone does not count), item-d nobody. Case 2, ticked [cabin, flat]: holders of item-a swap. Case 3: unticked shed does not appear. Case 4: an unknown id and a repeated id change nothing. Case 5: nothing ticked gives an empty view.",
  "source": "docs/sync.md",
